OTOGAKURE — CLASSIFIED
CLEARANCE: HEAD MEDIC ONLY
Ref: BT-SCHED

SUBJECT: Living Corpse Reincarnation — Transfer Cycle Schedule

Standing Rule
Each vessel may be inhabited for three years before a fresh transfer is required. As the
term nears, the current body degrades and Lord Orochimaru's power is constrained. The
schedule below ensures a prepared host is always in reserve.

Cycle Tracking
- Current vessel: term entering final quarter. Degradation within expected bounds.
- Interim host (reserve): prepared and held in stasis at the primary compound. To be used
  only if the preferred vessel is not secured before term expiry.
- Preferred vessel: designated Uchiha subject. Retrieval is the highest standing priority
  of the village (see Sasuke retrieval mission). All other objectives yield to it.

Contingency
If the preferred vessel is not secured before term, transfer to the reserve host and
extend the acquisition window by one full cycle. Do not allow the term to lapse with no
host prepared — that outcome is unacceptable.

Access to this schedule is limited to the Head Medic. No copies.
